      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently praise the veterinarians and nurses at Abbeville Road for their warm, welcoming, and knowledgeable approach. Clients note that staff remember their pets by name, though a couple of reviewers felt corporate aftercare could be more compassionate."
      }
    },
