      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach with sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight that veterinary staff handle lively dogs and feisty or elderly cats with patience and affection. Owners describe visits as enjoyable rather than stressful, appreciating the calm handling during routine examinations, nail clips, and health reviews."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
