        "en": "Effective routine healthcare and travel checks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report smooth outcomes for routine wellness examinations, booster vaccinations, and animal health certificates for travel abroad. Pet owners express lasting confidence in the clinical treatments and practical advice provided for their cats and dogs."
      }
    }
